# Reference: https://docs.gitlab.com/user/project/codeowners/reference/
#
# A single section, so a change needs one approval from the owners of the last
# pattern that matches it. The specific patterns repeat the maintainers because
# a later pattern replaces the owners of an earlier one rather than adding to
# them.
#
# Documentation is owned jointly so technical writing can approve a docs-only
# change without a maintainer.
#
# /docs-locale/ holds translations opened by the localization pipeline. It is
# owned by the localization tech docs maintainers, who approve translations.
# The CLI maintainers are co-owners only so they can unblock a release.

